      {
        "@id": "ArtifactNode:00CJ2TCV40000:props:StringProp:00CN3YXG28000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "description",
        "value": "Scope, transport, rendering and auth decisions for the webapp, each with the alternative it was chosen over — see [design/webapp.md](../design/webapp.md#id/BlockNode:00CJ6TGSX8001) for the settled result."
      }
    ],
    "title": "webapp.md",
    "text": "**Scope**: `webapp` is the third thin wrapper over the shared `core` engine, alongside `cli` — anticipated by name in [cli's Settled scope](../discussion/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CF2AEMER007), and sitting over the engine described in [core's Dashboard](../discussion/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZE18001). Its subject is the **UI projection** tier only; the i-projection it consumes belongs to [treeview](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1DDF4G001).",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4BR001",
